          ],
          "Size": [
            1700,
            144
          ]
        },
        "UI Text": {
          "Text": "Click a box to kick it; right-click builds a tile, Shift+right-click digs one out (TileBuilder); G flips gravity for a moment, B makes the boxes bouncy (GravityPulse); E ties the nearest box to the player on a rope, E again lets go (Tether); Q hangs the boxes in the air, H makes them heavy (BoxHang); the blue lift on the left rides up and down (Lift); the lookout on the wall turns red when something solid hides the player, coins don't (Lookout); the mouse wheel zooms, the middle button puts it back (ScrollZoom); clicking another window pauses the game (FocusPause); top right, frames and physics steps per second counted by coroutines (FrameWatcher)",
          "Font": 0,
          "Font Size": 26,
          "Color": [
            1,
            1,
            1,
            0.85
          ],
          "Alignment": 0,
          "Vertical Alignment": 0,
          "Wrap": true
        }
      }
    },
